          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰባት ፡ ሥራ ፡ ከታዘዙ ፡ ከሰባቱ ፡ መላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እክት ፡ አንዱ ፡ ደኃርያት ፡ አለ ፡ ሰባተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኛው፡ መጥቅዕ ፡ ሲፈጸም ፡ ነውና ፡ ከእኔ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋራ ፡ ተነጋገረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤለኒ፡ነዐ፡አርኢከሃ፡ለመርዓት፡ለብእሲተ፡በግዑ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በግዑ ፡ ለተዋሐዳት ፡ ለምእመን ፡ የተሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጠች፡ መንግሥተ ፡ ሰማይን ፡ ና ፡ ላሳይህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለኝ ። አንድም ፡ ለና ፡ ለ ፡ አንድ ፡ ወገን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በግዑ ፡ የተዋሐዳት ፡ ምእመንን፡ ላሳይህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ና፡ አለኝ ፡ ም፡ ፲፭፡ ፩፡ ፮፡ ፯ ። ም ፡ ፲፱፡፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": "፲",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲ ፤ ወወሰደኒ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ደብር ፡ ዐቢይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
